# Rituály listing

`/svatebni-ritualy` uses `Sections/ritualy.twig`.

## Layout

- Intro reuses homepage text hero (`.home-hero.home-hero--text`): kicker, title, longer lead, blurb, CTA → kontakt (“Napsat o rituálu”)
- Wedding cards: greige panels, **portrait photo peeking from the left**, text on the right (from 801px). Phones stack portrait on top.
- Prefer portrait listing images via `Post::getPreferredImage("portrait")`
- Grid: **max 2 columns** from 801px; `.75rem` white gaps
- Title = newlywed names from materialize; summary = crafted perex
- No scroll / entrance animations
